  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "The key to this dish is using natural peanut butter without added sugar. The stew gets its body from the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "groundnut",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "groundnut"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " paste dissolving into the tomato base. A "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "scotch bonnet",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "scotch-bonnet"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " adds the right fruity heat, but any chilli works."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Stir frequently once the peanut butter goes in. It will stick and scorch on the bottom if left unattended over high heat."
          }
        ]
      },
